@@ -0,0 +1,73 @@
+# XODUS for Heroic Games Launcher
+
+Native integration for Xbox Game Pass (PC) and Microsoft Store titles directly inside [Heroic Games Launcher](https://heroicgameslauncher.com/).
+
+---
+
+## 🎯 Features
+
+- **Store Manager**: Fully integrated alongside Epic, GOG, and Amazon Prime stores.
+- **Catalog & Library**:
+  - Browse the complete PC Game Pass catalog with high-resolution Box Art / Covers fetched via Microsoft Store API.
+  - View personal library and title history.
+- **Install & Stream**:
+  - Direct download and decompression of MSIXVC packages via `xodus-cli`.
+  - Idempotent repair and verification.
+- **Wine & Proton GDK Runner**:
+  - Native support for GDK APIs (`xgameruntime`, `XGameSave`, `XStore`, `XPackage`, `XUser`).
+  - Seamless DXVK and NVIDIA/AMD GPU integration.
+
+---
+
+## 🚀 Quick Start & Installation
+
+### 1. Requirements
+
+- Linux (x86_64) with systemd / DMI sysfs support.
+- `xodus-cli` installed in `$PATH` (or located at `~/.local/bin/xodus-cli`).
+- GDK-compatible Proton runtime (e.g. XODUS Bleeding Edge Proton).
+
+### 2. Automated Setup
+
+Run the included installation script:
+
+```bash
+chmod +x scripts/install-xodus-heroic.sh
+./scripts/install-xodus-heroic.sh
+```
+
+### 3. Authentication
+
+To authenticate your Xbox account for Game Pass entitlement:
+
+```bash
+xodus-cli login
+```
+
+Once authenticated, launch Heroic and navigate to **XODUS / Xbox Game Pass** in the sidebar.
+
+---
+
+## ⚙️ Configuration & Proton GDK Setup
+
+For titles requiring GDK authentication, saves, and store queries (e.g., *Fallout 4*, *Vampire Survivors*, *Grounded*):
+
+1. Set the Wine/Proton runner to the **XODUS GDK Proton** build in Heroic Game Settings.
+2. Ensure DXVK is enabled for DirectX 11/12 rendering.
+3. For custom language settings (e.g., Polish `sLanguage=pl`), configuration files (`Fallout4.ini`, `Fallout4Custom.ini`) are placed automatically inside the Wine user prefix (`<prefix>/drive_c/users/<user>/Documents/My Games/<Game>/`).
+
+---
+
+## 🛠️ Architecture
+
+- **`src/backend/storeManagers/xodus/`**: Core TypeScript integration implementing Heroic's `StoreManager` interface.
+- **`src/backend/library/xodus.ts`**: Library management, catalog fetching, and cover art resolution.
+- **`src/frontend/screens/XodusCatalog/`**: Native React UI for browsing Game Pass catalog.
+- **`scripts/`**: Setup and installation helpers.
+
+---
+
+## 🔒 Privacy & Safety
+
+- All credentials and authentication tokens are managed securely through Xbox Live Sisu/OAuth flows via `xodus-cli`.
+- No proprietary or private user tokens are stored in the launcher codebase.
